note SC1-E pure public partition helper, not a scheduler or secrecy proof.
note Record8: format,owner,reservation-id,public-boundary,active,capacity,partition,zero.
note Open once before any secret work. Owner/id refer to existing writer reservation.
note Fixed public partition must cover descendants, cleanup and supervisor work too.
note Failure leaves record unchanged. State and boundary are trusted writer inputs.
note Copies do not mint authority: only the single serialized owner may mutate live state.
fn ep_valid e view ulong 8 to ulong
if ne get e 0 1
ret 1
end
if or eq get e 1 0 or eq get e 2 0 eq get e 3 0
ret 1
end
if or gt get e 4 1 ne get e 7 0
ret 1
end
if or eq get e 6 0 gt get e 6 get e 5
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
fn ep_open e edit ulong 8 owner ulong id ulong boundary ulong cap ulong part ulong to ulong
for i ulong 8
if ne get e i 0
ret 1
end
end
if or eq owner 0 or eq id 0 eq boundary 0
ret 1
end
if or eq part 0 gt part cap
ret 1
end
put e 0 1
put e 1 owner
put e 2 id
put e 3 boundary
put e 4 1
put e 5 cap
put e 6 part
ret 0
end
fn ep_available e view ulong 8 to ulong
if ne ep_valid e 0
ret 0
end
if eq get e 4 0
ret get e 5
end
ret sub get e 5 get e 6
end
note event1 completion,2 cancellation,3 error,4 supervisor-work. None refunds.
fn ep_event e edit ulong 8 event ulong to ulong
if ne ep_valid e 0
ret 1
end
if or lt event 1 gt event 4
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
note Unknown quiescence returns4 and retains. Do not certify secret-dependent release delay.
note Boundary is a public schedule identity, not a secret-selected completion timestamp.
fn ep_release e edit ulong 8 boundary ulong quiet bool to ulong
if ne ep_valid e 0
ret 1
end
if ne boundary get e 3
ret 2
end
if not quiet
ret 4
end
put e 4 0
ret 0
end
